      "about": {
        "title": "Small footprint, full sauna experience",
        "lede": "The 552 proves you don’t need a big yard for a real Finnish-style sauna. Here’s what makes it work.",
        "items": [
          [
            "Canadian red cedar, inside and out",
            "Grade-A western red cedar resists rot and moisture, stays cool to the touch and smells incredible when it heats up. Choose knotty for a rustic look or clear for a smooth, knot-free finish."
          ],
          [
            "A real view from the bench",
            "A tall bronze glass panel and full glass door fill the room with light. Prefer privacy? Switch to mirrored glass or slatted semi-privacy panels."
          ],
          [
            "Built for Ontario winters",
            "A weather-resistant EPDM roof, double-sealed glass and raised base skids keep it dry and heating well through freeze, thaw and snow."
          ],
          [
            "Ready in about a day",
            "It ships as precut panels. Our team delivers and installs it in about 5 to 6 hours, typically 2 to 4 weeks after you order."
          ]
        ]
      },
